; @platform/* packages publish to and consume from GitHub Packages (ADR-012,
; resolved 2026-11-05; namespace constraint resolved 2026-11-06).
; Scope mapping is committed so `npm publish` can never accidentally target
; npmjs.org. The scope MUST equal the GitHub account owning this repo —
; see docs/release-train.md before changing either side.
@platform:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com

; Auth deliberately lives OUTSIDE the repo (R-ENV-03): pnpm refuses to expand
; env-var tokens from repository-controlled .npmrc files (warns and ignores
; them), so no token line belongs here. Auth goes into the user-level
; ~/.npmrc instead:
;   CI:   actions/setup-node with registry-url writes it from NODE_AUTH_TOKEN
;   local: //npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=<classic PAT>  (tool-managed
;          credential, never committed)
; This repo itself needs no token: @platform/* resolve to workspace links.
